cked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  06 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 14 03 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number are multiple fragments of core biopsies up to REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  Submitted in cassette A  Resident  GARY LETTS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Angela Ann Giardino  M D  Daniel Benjamin Kopans  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   CORE BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
