tioning reveals unremarkable breast parenchyma  The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast deep margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm breast tissue with a stitch designating the final margin which is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable breast parenchyma  The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final medial margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm breast tissue with a stitch on one aspect designating the final margin which is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal solid tan pink breast parenchyma  The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast re excision   are three unoriented fragments of breast tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The largest fragment contains an overlying REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan elliptical portion of skin  The external surfaces of all three fragments are entirely inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal tan pink breast parenchyma with focal calcifications  The specimen is entirely submitted with the largest fragment in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   medium fragment in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and small fragment  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL SUPERIOR MARGIN   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT  LATERAL MARGIN   EXCISION PART C  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL LATERAL MARGIN   EXCISION PART D  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL DEEP MARGIN   EXCISION PART E  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL MEDIAL MARGIN   EXCISION PART F  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION  report_end  , Unchecked