reas with cysts containing tan serous fluid  The largest area measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 8cm  and is located 0 5cm from the deep margin  2 8cm from the inferior margin  3 2cm from the lateral margin  3 5cm from the medial margin and 5 4cm from the superior margin  The rest of the breast tissue is fibrofatty with no other masses or lesions identified  Sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of breast tissue at the suspicious 4 o clock area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Section of the fibrocystic lesion to the deep margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the fibrocystic area  under the nipple and at 6 o clock   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Deep margins from the suspicious area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative section from other quadrants of the breast  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast short stitch superior  long lateral   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm breast with a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm tan light brown nipple  The breast is oriented with the short stitch designating the superior aspect and the long stitch designating the lateral aspect  The anterior surface is inked blue  the posterior surface is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral  Sectioning reveals a tan yellow fatty cut surface with tan pinkish white areas of fibrosis  There are multiple tan pinkish white rubbery areas that are consistent with a fibrocystic change  The fibrocystic area is located predominantly under the nipple and measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 2cm  it is located 0 5cm from the deep margin  3 0cm from the inferior margin  3 0cm from the lateral margin  3 7cm from the medial margin and 5 0cm from the superior margin  The rest of the breast tissue appears tan pink to yellow with no gross abnormalities noted  Please note the fibrocystic lesion appears to abut the anterior surface  Section