or  Negative  too low  progesterone receptor  Positive 25 fm mg cytosolic protein Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  14 AUG 93 at 12 10 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Left breast mass  is a 5 x 4 x 1 5cm mass of fibrofatty tissue with a localizing wire in place  This specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal an ill defined tan yellow  firm nodule not well delineated from the surrounding parenchyma measuring 2 x 2 x 2 5cm  A representative section is submitted as frozen section  1  The closest inked margin is 1 to 2mm and is submitted in cassettes A and B  The remainder of the tissue is submitted in cassettes C through L  BRDU  ER PR is sent  Frozen section is kept frozen  An x ray of the specimen with localizing wire in place also accompanies the specimen  Resident  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LEFT BREAST MASS   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Timothy R  Quinn  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Christophe Girardet  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Randall David Gaz  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST MASS , Unchecked.
