ained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  11 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 10 59 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  in two parts  Labeled  lateral right breast  are two portions of breast tissue  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  Both are inked and sectioned to reveal unremarkable parenchyma  No discrete lesions are noted  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes A through C  Labeled  medial right breast  are two portions of breast tissue  1 x 1 x 1cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  Both are inked and sectioned to reveal a 1 1cm firm area abutting the inked resection margin grossly  A representative section is frozen as FX  1 and resubmitted in cassette D  The remainder of the tissue is submitted in cassettes E through H  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  HONGMEI LI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  NO AREA SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   MEDIAL RIGHT BREAST   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA VERY CLOSE TO OR AT AN INKED RESECTION MARGIN  DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  PRESENT AT AN INKED RESECTION MARGIN  O R  Resident  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT  LATERAL    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   MEDIAL    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
